SUMMARY:Jing Ying Cantonese Opera
LOCATION:Children's Creativity Museum Theater\, 221 4th St\, San Francisco
 \, CA 94103\, San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Jing Ying Cantonese Opera Institute presents a Cantonese opera
  performance followed by a talkback at Yerba Buena Gardens. The programme
  features two classic scenes in full costume: "Noble Sacrifice" (帝女
 花之香夭) from the Story of Princess Cheung Ping\, performed by Judy 
 Jung (程小勳) and Esther Tang (鄭宗妃)\, and "Tragedy at the Temple
 " (打神)\, performed by Shirley Ng (陳小梨). A live musical ensemble
  accompanies the scenes\, which are sung in Cantonese with English supert
 itles.\n\nTickets / RSVP: https://ma.to/event/jing-ying-cantonese-opera-2
 026-11-21\n\nConcerts + Musical theatre · 5.1 mi from home
